// Rimeshelf layout (WP-066): greybox blocks (scaled `block_unit`, centered on `pos`). Y is up, +Z is
// north. The highland is flat (terrain.ron). Places, with extents (x, z):
//   the back gate      x -9..9, z -117..-115   the castle's back gate comes out here; the spawn
//                      stands just north of it
//   Rimeshelf Pass     the packed spine x -6..6 from z -112 to z 76; L18 at (0, -98); wolves and
//                      Frost Husks in the deep snow either side
//   the Whitewarden gate   x 103..105, z -37..-23   a pylon arch east of L19 (70, -30); the
//                      connection to the catacombs is just past it
//   the Bound Ring gate    the same arch, west of L21 (-80, -30), at x -105..-103
//   the Frozen Foundry x -66..-14, z -4..52   walls 8 m high; the east door at z 4..10; the
//                      casting floor (z -2..30), the annex (z 32..50): the chimney room (x
//                      -40..-16) and the office (x -64..-42)
//   Bellwright's Steps a 20 m ramp (x -8..8, z 56..76) up to the terrace (y 6): L20 at (0, 6, 80);
//                      B10's fog gate is the plane z = 96 across the gap in the arena wall (x -6..6)
//   the arena          x -26..26, z 96..122   the Great Bell frozen in the north cliff
// Colliders are axis-aligned boxes, so every doorway is a gap between two boxes plus a lintel.
// Walks between Lanterns are checked by world_state/rime_tests.rs.
